{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>One goat.</b> We learned there at the end of tractate Rosh HaShanah: the people of the West, Rav Mesharshiya says in the name of Rabbi Aḥa: in all the offerings חטאת is written, but on Atzeret חטאת is not written. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to Israel: since you have accepted upon yourselves the yoke of My Torah, I account it upon you as if you have never sinned from your beginning."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:08.148556145Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}